# Concrete sidewalk slabs, one per tile, with a single seam line on the bottom
# and right edge of each slab. Frame 0 is clean; 1 to 3 carry a crack, a chip
# and a spot of gum.
sprite floor-sidewalk
size 16 16
layer floor
tag floor street

